blurb = "Depicts a famous aristocrat, Wake no Kiyomaro, kneeling before a Shinto altar at Usa Hachiman Shrine. He wears a flowing brown tunic over a red robe with silver mica accents, and white pants. The altar is set with bowls and pots containing offerings, and a vase holding evergreen foliage."
